ention to physical realism using the Havok Physics engine, every block interaction feels dynamic, weighty, and unpredictable. Challenge friends or strangers online in a simple-to-learn, hard-to-master game where the smallest move can mean total collapse. Strategically pull and stack bricks, use special power-ups, and adapt to wobbling chaos in solo or multiplayer. With every match procedurally generated and physics-powered, no two towers tumble the same.", "short_description": "Stack, slide, and survive in Tower Tumble! Build the ultimate block tower, pull pieces without causing collapse, and challenge friends or chaos in solo mode. With power-ups and unpredictable physics, every move counts in this high-stakes balance game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.mdrngames.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MDRNgames INC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.mdrngames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28869644152679503"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 10, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2336758160430375"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1790547642259379"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1477019770959686"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED